1
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,720
It's quite lively here.

2
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:05,239
What's going on?

3
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,960
Bullying a widow and her child,

4
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,200
that's not very honorable, brother.

5
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,360
What are you guys doing?

6
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,000
She owes us money.

7
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,440
What's wrong with taking goods to pay off the debt?

8
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:16,120
Paying one's debts

9
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,520
is only right and proper.

10
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,560
Boss Chen,

11
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:20,690
I brought the goods you wanted.

12
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,760
Looks like we came at the right time.

13
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:24,760
Mr. Wang,

14
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,289
why are you here?

15
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:29,200
Don't blame me for not showing you respect.

16
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:29,760
Let me tell you,

17
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:32,420
today is a private matter between Chen Lu and me.

18
00:01:32,759 --> 00:01:34,160
Everything in this factory

19
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:35,080
belongs to us.

20
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,890
It's not easy for me either.

21
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,920
My men are waiting to eat.

22
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,200
Boss Wang,

23
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,759
let's settle this peacefully.

24
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:42,720
How much does Boss Chen owe you?

25
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:43,780
I'll pay it for her.

26
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:46,160
Let's not delay Boss Chen's unloading.

27
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,560
Unload?

28
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,440
You're unloading?

29
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,330
What are you unloading?

30
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:52,720
Did I let you unload?

31
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:54,330
Brother,

32
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,039
I...

33
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Wait, Boss Wang.

34
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,000
What?

35
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,400
How much does Boss Chen owe you?

36
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,360
35,000.

37
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,600
I'll settle her debt.

38
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,170
Thank you, Mr. Wang.

39
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,000
Thank you.

40
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,530
Mr. Wang, right?

41
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:49,140
No matter why you helped me today,

42
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,200
you really saved my neck.

43
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,520
This favor,

44
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:55,100
I, Chen Lu, will remember.

45
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:57,420
You're too polite, Boss Chen.

46
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,300
Businessmen help each other out.

47
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,680
Let's go out and check the goods.

48
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,160
Boss Chen,

49
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,760
take a look at these goods

50
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,960
and see if they meet your requirements.

51
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:22,640
Wonderful.

52
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,680
Truly wonderful.

53
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,000
Mr. Wang,

54
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:30,520
your timely help

55
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,040
really opened my eyes.

56
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,000
Director Chen,

57
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,880
you found some good wood.

58
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,410
The quality is nice.

59
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,720
Good for you.

60
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,060
I just wonder when Mr. Wang

61
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:46,160
became friends with Director Chen.

62
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,000
Last time at the karaoke room,

63
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:48,760
I asked you,

64
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,020
but you didn't tell me.

65
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,360
It's just a small matter.

66
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,560
Mr. Lin,

67
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,380
don't take it to heart.

68
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:58,200
You should have told me even if it's a small matter.

69
00:03:59,040 --> 00:03:59,800
Look,

70
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,480
we almost had a friendly fire

71
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,400
and caused a misunderstanding.

72
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:05,730
You must be joking, Mr. Lin.

73
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,480
I just did a small favor in passing.

74
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,960
A small favor?

75
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,080
This place is quite far.

76
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:14,960
It's the southern suburbs,

77
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,720
far from where you live.

78
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,880
Is this a small matter or a small favor?

79
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,959
This is unruly.

80
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:21,880
Nothing can be accomplished without rules.

81
00:04:21,880 --> 00:04:22,840
I advise you,

82
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,560
there are some favors

83
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,540
you shouldn't do blindly,

84
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:28,900
to avoid getting yourself into trouble.

85
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,880
I don't understand what you mean.

86
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,159
If you don't understand,

87
00:04:34,159 --> 00:04:35,620
think about it carefully.

88
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:45,850
You're all here.

89
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,770
Sorry to interrupt.

90
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,000
It's my dad calling.

91
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,460
Please answer it, Mr. Lin.

92
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:57,120
Uncle Li.

93
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:59,200
Mr. Lin, long time no see.

94
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:01,680
I heard you're with Mr. Wang right now.

95
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:05,360
We're just having a chat.

96
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,120
Here's the thing.

97
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:09,760
My factory's production capacity can't keep up today.

98
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:11,620
I can't use up all my timber quota.

99
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,680
Rather than leaving it idle,

100
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,760
I might as well give it to someone who needs it.

101
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:16,760
Your factory is large,

102
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:17,600
so you'll definitely need it.

103
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,480
I'm getting old,

104
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,520
and I can't handle the hustle anymore.

105
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,520
You and Wang Hong,

106
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:21,680
Mr. Wang,

107
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,440
are business partners.

108
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,450
It's all just business.

109
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,520
There's no need to make things too tense.

110
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,120
Uncle Li.

111
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,240
Since you've put it that way,

112
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:33,050
as the younger generation,

113
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:35,760
it would be ignorant of us not to listen.

114
00:05:36,159 --> 00:05:37,020
How about this?

115
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,400
After I'm done with these two days,

116
00:05:38,400 --> 00:05:39,330
I'll arrange it.

117
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:42,120
I'll invite you, Xuefei,

118
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,400
and Mr. Wang to get together.

119
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,440
We'll sit down,

120
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,680
have a few drinks,

121
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,810
and have a good chat.

122
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:47,440
Okay.

123
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:52,440
Mr. Wang.

124
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,560
I'll just call you Brother Wang.

125
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:57,960
I'll say it again.

126
00:05:58,520 --> 00:05:59,520
I am completely

127
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,800
sincere with you.

128
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,440
I hope you are too.

129
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:06,380
I'll keep your words in mind, Mr. Lin.

130
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,080
Alright, if there's nothing else,

131
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:09,810
I'm leaving.

132
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,970
The matter is settled, Dad.

133
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:17,010
I'll hang up now.

134
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:22,920
Miss Li.

135
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:25,680
Thank you so much for your help today.

136
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,040
There's no need to thank me.

137
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,240
We are all business people.

138
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,440
It's mutual benefit.

139
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:31,880
But,

140
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:34,980
how did you know I was here?

141
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,080
I...

142
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,240
I have some things to do.

143
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,240
I have to go first.

144
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:47,680
Do you have enough people?

145
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:48,720
Let me stay and help you.

146
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:49,320
No need.

147
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,890
It's just some personal business.

148
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,920
Then I'll head back first.

149
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:55,520
Call me if you need anything.

150
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:04,200
Mr. Wang, please

151
00:07:04,200 --> 00:07:06,200
calculate how much this wood costs.

152
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:07,080
Also,

153
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,280
the 35,000 yuan

154
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:09,880
you just advanced for me,

155
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:13,320
as soon as the payment for this batch of goods comes in,

156
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:15,000
I'll transfer it to you immediately.

157
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:15,720
Boss Chen.

158
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,720
No need to be so serious.

159
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:21,010
We might have chances to cooperate in the future.

160
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,280
These two workers will stay to help you unload.

161
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:25,160
I also wish you

162
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,720
a speedy completion of the order.

163
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,580
I'll get going.

164
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,800
Thank you, Uncle Wang.

165
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,480
Thank you.

166
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,260
No problem.

167
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,280
Goodbye.

168
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,280
Pretty lady.

169
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,730
What are you doing here?

170
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:00,760
I'll treat you to skewers tonight.

171
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:03,000
I know a place that's really good.

172
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,410
Do you see that tricycle ahead?

173
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,240
I don't think you can catch up with them.

174
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,280
Why wouldn't I be able to?

175
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:13,280
Get in.

176
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:16,840
Come on!

177
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,480
One, two, three, go!

178
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:20,160
Manman.

179
00:08:21,400 --> 00:08:21,960
Manman.

180
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,680
What do you want?

181
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:27,880
I mean,

182
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,880
there's not even a place to shower here.

183
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,280
I'm starting to smell.

184
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:32,720
Smell me if you don't believe it.

185
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,080
Do you want to die?

186
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,000
Don't you know what's going on outside?

187
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,600
The police were still patrolling nearby during the day.

188
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,330
Are you trying to get me killed?

189
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,640
I know I was wrong.

190
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:41,840
I won't go out.

191
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:47,320
But I might want to go home and get some clothes later.

192
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:49,840
Teng Xiaohu.

193
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,440
By taking you in, I've already put my life

194
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,640
on the line.

195
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:55,280
Mr. Song has been looking at me weirdly these past two days.

196
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:56,080
Every day,

197
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,440
I'm terrified.

198
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:59,200
My legs go weak when I hear a police car.

199
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,640
I'm begging you.

200
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,080
Once this blows over,

201
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:03,540
just leave quickly, okay?

202
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,200
Okay.

203
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,280
I got it.

204
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:06,440
I'll go in now.

205
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,730
Is anyone there?

206
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:11,120
Get in. Get in quickly.

207
00:09:14,920 --> 00:09:15,760
Nurse Yang.

208
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,080
Coming.

209
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:23,640
Coming.

210
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,250
Officer Cao.

211
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,360
You're still up so late, Nurse Yang.

212
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,280
Organizing the medical records I didn't finish during the day.

213
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,120
Officer Cao.

214
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:35,000
What brings you here so late?

215
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,650
Mr. Song is already asleep.

216
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:37,920
Nothing much.

217
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:39,000
Just passing by.

218
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:40,800
I was doing some interviews nearby this afternoon,

219
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,280
and suddenly remembered something

220
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,340
I wanted to ask you.

221
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,640
Did you

222
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:48,200
date Teng Xiaohu before?

223
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,360
That's ancient history.

224
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:52,560
We were young

225
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,680
and naive back then.

226
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:55,440
We had a bad breakup.

227
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,480
We pretend not to know each other when we meet.

228
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,920
Then how come I heard

229
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:02,100
Teng Xiaohu came to see you before his accident?

230
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,320
How is that possible?

231
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,080
Officer Cao,

232
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,760
who told you that?

233
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:07,980
I avoid guys like him like the plague.

234
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,600
That's good.

235
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,250
I just heard it from others.

236
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:13,640
Teng Xiaohu is currently on the run.

237
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,120
If you see him

238
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:17,080
or know any information,

239
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:19,180
you must contact us immediately.

240
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,680
He has a gun now.

241
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:22,360
It's very unsafe for you

242
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:23,800
and Dr. Song.

243
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:25,160
Don't worry, Officer Cao.

244
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:27,360
I'll report any news immediately.

245
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,120
Xiaoman.

246
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,760
Who is it?

247
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,240
Dr. Song, it's Officer Cao.

248
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:31,920
Dr. Song.

249
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:34,440
Officer Cao.

250
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,400
Do you need something this late?

251
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:38,240
Nothing much.

252
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,040
Just a few words

253
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,320
with Nurse Yang.

254
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,400
I won't bother you any longer.

255
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:45,200
Get some rest.

256
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,520
Got a lead.

257
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:56,690
I'll be right there.

258
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,520
Dr. Song, I'll get going.

259
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:00,160
Okay.

260
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,000
Nurse Yang.

261
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,400
If you remember anything,

262
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,260
you must contact us immediately.

263
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,360
Xiaoman.

264
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,050
Go lock the door.

265
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,040
Zhezhan.

266
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,980
Don't just stand there. Sit down.

267
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,200
Mr. Song.

268
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,700
Is there something wrong?

269
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:33,760
Xiaoman.

270
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,040
I've noticed you've been

271
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,440
a bit distracted lately.

272
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,620
Are you hiding something from me?

273
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,400
Tell me the truth.

274
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,160
Did Teng Xiaohu

275
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,840
come to see you secretly?

276
00:11:48,800 --> 00:11:49,880
How is that possible?

277
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:51,880
I haven't seen him since we broke up.

278
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:52,920
Really.

279
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:59,240
The police are searching all over Xinchun for him.

280
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:01,600
Don't you know what's going on?

281
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:02,960
Tell me,

282
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,960
how many times have the police come to our door?

283
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:07,440
Mr. Song.

284
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,880
I really didn't.

285
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:16,610
You've been soft-hearted since you were a child.

286
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,280
If Teng Xiaohu really comes to find you,

287
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,840
you must not talk to him.

288
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,760
You two are not from the same world.

289
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:23,880
You will only torture each other.

290
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:26,290
